   861	- <a id="decided-project-pipeline-2026-11-06"></a>**The new compiler pipeline** (owner, 2026-11-06,
   862	  relayed by the orchestrator from the owner session: the owner asked "is there any way to improve the full compiler design or pipeline?"; after
   863	  the Codex, agy and Kimi pipeline review was reported, "did we also log that we will have the new
